:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Enter []
<<location 'tentworld'>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<tentacleworldintro>><<set $tentacleEntrance to 'vanillaPlusMirror'>>
<<switch $VanillaPlus.deviancy.mirrorOrigin>>
  <<case 'farm'>>
    <<set $tentnorth to 3>><<set $tenteast to -3>>
  <<case 'tower'>>
    <<set $tentnorth to -3>><<set $tenteast to 3>>
<</switch>>
<<if !$daily.vanillaPlusMirror>>
  <<set $daily.vanillaPlusMirror to true>><<deviancy6>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The glass clings to your skin like a wet membrane. You force your body through and spill out beneath the alien sky of the tentacle
    plains.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    镜面如湿润的薄膜般贴紧你的皮肤。你迫使身体穿过其中，跌入触手平原陌生的天空之下。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink 'Next' 'Tentacle Plains'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Home []
<<set $location to 'home'>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<tentacleworldend>>
<<language>>
<<option 'EN'>>
  You force yourself through the rippling surface and tumble back into your bedroom.
<<option 'CN'>>
  你挤过荡漾的镜面，跌回自己的卧室。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink 'Next' 'Bedroom'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Farm []
<<set $location to 'farm'>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<tentacleworldend>>
<<language>>
<<option 'EN'>>
  You force yourself through the rippling surface and stumble into your room at the farm.
<<option 'CN'>>
  你挤过荡漾的镜面，踉跄着落进农场的房间。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink 'Next' 'Farm Bedroom'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Tower []
<<set $location to 'tower'>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<tentacleworldend>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You force yourself through the rippling surface and spill onto the tower floor.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你挤过荡漾的镜面，摔落在高塔的地面上。
<</language>>
<br><br><<lanLink 'Next' 'Bird Tower'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Conduct []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'forest_shop'>><<effects>><<npc Gwylan>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Gwylan')>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You tell Gwylan that you want to lead the next cleansing. You have felt the forest's poison squirm through your body often enough.
    This time, you want it to follow your rhythm.
  <br><br>
  <<He>> stops arranging the bottles behind the counter. <<His>> gaze lingers on you. "You've learned how it moves through you," <<he>> says. "And
    the forest answers when you open yourself to it. That doesn't mean it belongs to you."
  <br><br>
  <<He>> selects several bottles and places them in a case. "You may set the pace and guide the current. I'll prepare the reagents and hold the seal.
    <span class="red">If I tell you to stop, you stop.</span> It doesn't matter how good it feels if the poison escapes back into the world."
  <br><br>
  <span class="lewd">A familiar heat stirs inside you.</span> Gwylan notices, and smiles. "Very well. Show me what your body has learned."
  <br><br>
  <<link [[Begin the cleansing|Gwylan Ritual Start]]>><<run maplebirch.VP.deviancy.begin()>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[Not today|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><</link>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你告诉格威岚，下一场净化仪式想由自己主持。森林的毒素已经在你的身体里蠕动过太多次。这一次，你想让它顺从你的节奏。
  <br><br>
  <<He>>停下整理柜台后方瓶罐的动作，目光在你身上停留片刻。“你已经学会毒素如何在体内游走，”<<he>>说道，“当你主动向森林敞开身体，它也会回应你。
    但这不代表它属于你。”
  <br><br>
  <<He>>挑出几只瓶子，放进箱中。“你可以控制节奏，引导毒素的流向。药剂和封印仍由我负责。<span class="red">我让你停下时，你就必须停下。</span>
    无论过程多么舒服，毒素若重新逃回这个世界，净化就不算成功。”
  <br><br>
  <span class="lewd">熟悉的热意在你体内浮现。</span>格威岚注意到了，露出微笑。“很好。让我看看你的身体都学会了什么。”
  <br><br>
  <<link [[开始净化仪式|Gwylan Ritual Start]]>><<run maplebirch.VP.deviancy.begin()>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[今天还是算了|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><</link>>
<</language>>
